Chalte Chalte Guitar tabs with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie Mitron sung by Atif Aslam. The song is origanally was from old Hindi movie Pakeezah sang by Lata Mangeshkar.

Strumming Pattern: DDU UDU

